& [Threats]
  + T01 self-issued or substituted operator authorization is accepted as authentic consent
  + T02 commission UUID attempt or expected-current identity is replayed after terminal use
  + T03 scope alias rooted path parent traversal case or separator normalization widens the effect surface
  + T04 capability omission reordering overlap or extra grant promotes downstream authority
  + T05 lease is acquired after first effect released early waited on or silently recovered
  + T06 consumption ledger is written after reserved effect deleted replaced retried or cleaned
  + T07 HEAD upstream origin branch root inventory carrier executable capacity or process state changes between observation and effect
  + T08 pre-effect drift is mislabeled as success or post-claim uncertainty is laundered as NotRun
  + T09 imported B0 or Rev0.4 physical-contact authority digest or profile is mutated
  + T10 pure admission grows a process filesystem registry clock Git network provider or unsafe carrier
  + T11 evidence duplicate unknown reorder oversize or second-replay nondeterminism is accepted
  + T12 physical broker P1 writer SWA-06B commit push activation cleanup D-drive WSL or foreign authority is inferred

& [Controls]
  + exact authorization artifact identity plus explicit commission_authenticated false controls T01 without overclaim
  + one attempt zero retry ledger-before-effect and no-delete policy control T02 and T06 at formation level
  + strict closed exact paths and raw string comparison control T03
  + seven-grant fifteen-denial exact ordered partition controls T04
  + closed nine-step fence continuous no-wait lease and second observation control T05 and T07
  + exact NotRun and Quarantined truth tables control T08
  + raw upstream artifact identity canonical replay and zero physical flags control T09
  + static forbidden-surface audit and module boundary control T10
  + strict parser bounds adversaries and double replay control T11
  + phase lock signature and zero-effect receipt control T12

& [Residual]
  + authentic operator signature verification current clock durable ledger atomicity named lease ACL process containment and crash recovery remain production-broker problems
  + current capacity and Windows Application Control independently prevent physical execution

& [Decision]
  + threats_bounded_for_pure_commission_admission_formation_only
